          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "Augustus controlled most of them."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "label": "The consuls could still overrule Augustus",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "Real power was his."
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "label": "Rome had no other way to name its years",
          "correct": false,
          "rationale": "The reason was political."
        }
